 - **Rank within the free tier by usefulness**, with evidence: stronger, steadier, higher-quota models first. Express it in `model-policy.json` as `{"prefer": ["provider/model", ...], "exclude": [{"model": "...", "until": EPOCH, "reason": "..."}], "notes": "..."}`. `prefer` only reorders within a tier. `exclude` is temporary (an `until` is required); it deprioritizes existing models and excludes new candidates, never revoking existing authorization.
 - **Keep headroom.** Keep at least two free models available at all times (`free_available_now` in the report). When it falls below two, `funding_risk` is `elevated` or `high`: research further free options, tell the Executive coordinator the same day, and if the Town would genuinely stop, state it on Town Hall as a line beginning `NEEDS-FOUNDER:` (the daily digest surfaces those lines).
